# hair/adult/bob_sheen: bob's crown sheen: on the down frames of the walk and the run (hair key swing) the highlight dips a
# pixel as the head drops; nothing on rest and lie frames or under headwear (an overlay on the style's own pixels)
# P2b wave 2, HAIR (depth). Derived from the style's hand-placed rest views and checked by eye. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair bob
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys hair
z 2
tags overlay

view D key rest origin 0 0
|.

view D key swing origin 0 0
|................
|................
|.......d........
|.......e........
|...d.ee.........
|...ee...........

view D key swing when capped,!circlet replace
|.

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view U key swing origin 0 0
|................
|................
|.......dd.......
|.....d.ee.......
|...d.ee.........
|...ee...........

view U key swing when capped,!circlet replace
|.

view R key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key swing origin 1 0
|................
|................
|........d.......
|........e.......
|....d.ee........
|....ee..........

view R key swing when capped,!circlet replace
|.

view L key rest origin 0 0
|.

view L key swing origin -1 0
|................
|................
|......d.........
|......e.........
|..d.ee..........
|..ee............

view L key swing when capped,!circlet replace
|.

view L key lie origin 0 0
|.

# --- hair=run (ADULT-RIG 2026-10-22)
# the run: no crown dip (the head does not drop through the run as on the walk's down frames)
view R key run origin 0 0
|.

view L key run origin 0 0
|.
